<title>POLAND: IRENA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>IRENA MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.80 vs   0.53</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.04 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.77 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Sales		    5.51 vs   5.05</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.00 vs   1.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.76 vs   2.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.82 vs   0.78</p>
<p> Sales		   14.38 vs  12.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glassmaker is Huta Szkla</p>
<p>Gospodarczego Irena SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
